1abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x \\in \\mathrm{Var}\\;(P(x))\">\\(\\forall x \\in \\mathrm{Var}\\;(P(x))\\)</span> (变量基始, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall c \\in \\mathrm{Const}\\;(P(c))\">\\(\\forall c \\in \\mathrm{Const}\\;(P(c))\\)</span> (常量基始, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c607e2e3c013a11\" href=\"?note=9c607e2e3c013a11\" title=\"57-df-constant\">57-df-constant</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n \\geq 1\\;\\forall f \\in \\mathrm{Func}_n\\;\\forall t_1, \\ldots, t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(P(t_1) \\land \\cdots \\land P(t_n) \\to P(f\\,t_1\\,\\ldots\\,t_n))\">\\(\\forall n \\geq 1\\;\\forall f \\in \\mathrm{Func}_n\\;\\forall t_1, \\ldots, t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(P(t_1) \\land \\cdots \\land P(t_n) \\to P(f\\,t_1\\,\\ldots\\,t_n))\\)</span> (函数符号兼容, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9a59657cbfef22b5\" href=\"?note=9a59657cbfef22b5\" title=\"57-df-function\">57-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Term\">\\(Term\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Term\">\\(Term\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\">\\(thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>此固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 环境中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}=\\mathrm{Const}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}=\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_n=\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_n=\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span>；省略签名参数的符号不表示额外集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction} \\vdash \\forall t \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(P(t))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}term\\text{-}induction} \\vdash \\forall t \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(P(t))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-constant","status":"resolved","id":"9c607e2e3c013a11","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-constant]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"9a59657cbfef22b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term",